{"id":"1dea640a186ddc67","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Poset Order Isomorphism","display":"df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism — ZFC Poset Order Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism — ZFC Poset Order Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-order-isomorphism — ZFC Poset Order Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fe34b1ba3bc153e\" href=\"?note=5fe34b1ba3bc153e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding\">58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> (partially ordered sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bij}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Bij}_S\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\">\\(\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\)</span> (order relations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderIsomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderIsomorphism}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderIsomorphism}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Bij}_S(f,P,Q)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}order\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderIsomorphism}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Bij}_S(f,P,Q)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Q f(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"5fe34b1ba3bc153e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,Q$ (partially ordered sets, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ (fun